## 8. Development Patch Scripts (Root Directory)

A few one-off scripts at the repo root (`add_official_member_dropdown.py`, `update_member_form.py`, `remove_misplaced_mappings.py`, `fix_ternary.py`) were automated patch utilities used during development to update `frontend/src/App.jsx` (the pre-`members-core` UI). They're not required to run the application and don't touch `api/` or the `members-core` frontend module.
